Project 1 — Microsoft Model Validation and AI-Use Record
Company: Microsoft Corporation (MSFT)
Valuation date: September 1, 2026
Prepared: October 19, 2026
Investment recommendation: WATCH / DEFER
1. Purpose and scope
This document records the model outputs, source checks, sensitivity tests, validation observations, and AI-use disclosure supporting the Edition B research and investment committee materials. It distinguishes observed checks from outstanding verification. It is not a claim that all inputs or methods have been independently audited.
